GamePad — Third-party notices
=============================

Last reviewed: 8 September 2026

GamePad bundles no third-party source code, images, audio, video or font files.
Every game is hand-written vanilla HTML/CSS/JS; all graphics are drawn at
runtime with Canvas 2D, CSS, inline SVG generated in the page, or Unicode
characters supplied by the reader's own system fonts.

The items below are the only third-party material the project touches.


